1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,853
Lo tau gak kenapa, malam itu,

2
00:00:01,853 --> 00:00:04,277
satu-satunya lampu yang nyala
di kampung justru ada di pos ronda

3
00:00:04,277 --> 00:00:05,950
yang kabelnya putus?

4
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:09,406
Kalau radio lo bunyi, gue traktir gorengan.

5
00:00:10,940 --> 00:00:12,932
Dua. Yang masih anget.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,729
Nar… tiga menit lagi kampung padam.

7
00:00:16,729 --> 00:00:18,038
Jangan masuk pos ronda.

8
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:23,375
Itu suara lo, Nar.

9
00:00:24,450 --> 00:00:25,770
Gue juga denger.

10
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:35,132
Kok… lampu pos masih nyala?

11
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:39,834
Bay, tunggu di situ.

12
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,332
Kalau lo lihat gue di dalam…

13
00:00:49,332 --> 00:00:50,420
jangan buka pintunya.

14
00:00:55,650 --> 00:00:57,951
Nar. Mundur.

15
00:01:01,680 --> 00:01:02,960
[Tiga ketukan dari pos]

16
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,700
[Tiga ketukan dari bengkel]
